      "side": 1,
      "message": "I found that using the original setup led to failures in the `accept_socket` method for L2CAP and RFCOMM, preventing connections from being accepted. Modifying the code to use `{\u0027timeout_ms\u0027: GLib.Variant(\u0027i\u0027, timeout)}` resolved the issue, enabling the `accept_socket` method to function correctly. Further investigation revealed that changing the key in `dbus_optional_value` from `optional_value` to `timeout_ms` also made the `accept_socket` method work as intended, unlike in the original setup where it wasn\u0027t working. This is why I updated the code.",
