      "writtenOn": "2024-02-23T09:45:44Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "One server socket id could be associated with multiple streams, consider making this a list.\n\nOr if the test flow guarantees to have at most 1 incoming connection, add comment here and in `__init__`.\n\n```suggestion\n                self.connection_stream.setdefault(connection_value, []).append(server_socket)\n```",
